AbstractVariety / AbstractVariety -- get a structure map
********************************************************

  * Operator: *note /: (Macaulay2Doc)/,
  * Usage: 
        X/S
  * Inputs:
      * X, an *note abstract variety: AbstractVariety,, 
      * S, an *note abstract variety: AbstractVariety,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an *note abstract variety map: AbstractVarietyMap,, the structure map
        or composition of structure maps $X \rightarrow{} S$

Description
===========

+------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : X = abstractProjectiveSpace_3 point        |
|                                                |
|o1 = X                                          |
|                                                |
|o1 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {1, 3}|
+------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : Y = abstractProjectiveSpace_2 X            |
|                                                |
|o2 = Y                                          |
|                                                |
|o2 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {1..2}|
+------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : Z = abstractProjectiveSpace_1 Y            |
|                                                |
|o3 = Z                                          |
|                                                |
|o3 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {2:1} |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : Z/Z                                        |
|                                                |
|o4 = a variety map                              |
|                                                |
|o4 : a map to Z from Z                          |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : Z/Y                                        |
|                                                |
|o5 = a variety map                              |
|                                                |
|o5 : a map to Y from Z                          |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : Z/X                                        |
|                                                |
|o6 = a variety map                              |
|                                                |
|o6 : a map to X from Z                          |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : Z/point                                    |
|                                                |
|o7 = a variety map                              |
|                                                |
|o7 : a map to point from Z                      |
+------------------------------------------------+

