blowup -- blow up an abstract variety along a subvariety
********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        (Ytilde, PN, PNmap, Ymap) = blowup(i)
  * Inputs:
      * i, an *note abstract variety map: AbstractVarietyMap,, the inclusion
        map of the subvariety $X$ to be blown up into the ambient variety $Y$
  * Outputs:
      * Ytilde, an *note abstract variety: AbstractVariety,, the blowup of $Y$
        along $X$
      * PN, an *note abstract flag bundle: FlagBundle,, the exceptional divisor
        of the blowup, the projectivization of the normal bundle of $i$
      * PNmap, an *note abstract variety map: AbstractVarietyMap,, the
        inclusion of $PN$ into the blowup
      * Ymap, an *note abstract variety map: AbstractVarietyMap,, the map from
        the blowup down to $Y$
  * Consequences:
      * The exceptional divisor as a sheaf on the blowup can be obtained via
        exceptionalDivisor Ytilde, see *note exceptionalDivisor:
        exceptionalDivisor,.

Description
===========

Blowing up a point in $\mathbb{P}^2$:

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : X = abstractProjectiveSpace 0                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = X                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {1, 0}                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : Y = abstractProjectiveSpace 2                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Y                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {1..2}                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : i = map(Y,X,OO_X)                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = i                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : a map to Y from X                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : (Ytilde, PN, PNmap, Ymap) = blowup(i)                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = (Ytilde, PN, PNmap, Ymap)                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : Ediv = chern(1, exceptionalDivisor Ytilde) -- the class of the          |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = E                                                                       |
|      0                                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|               QQ[][h, H   ..H   ]                                           |
|                        2,1   2,2                                            |
|     --------------------------------------[E ]                              |
|     (- h - H   , - h*H    - H   , -h*H   )  0                               |
|             2,1       2,1    2,2      2,2                                   |
|o5 : ------------------------------------------                              |
|                           2                                                 |
|                 (H   E , E  + H   )                                         |
|                   2,1 0   0    2,2                                          |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|exceptional divisor                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : integral (Ediv^2)                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = -1                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

As a more interesting example, we can derive the classical formula for the
degree of the zero-dimensional locus of intersection of three surfaces in
$\mathbb{P}^3$ containing a twisted cubic:

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : B = base(r,s,t)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = B                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : an abstract variety of dimension 0                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : X = abstractProjectiveSpace(1, B)                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = X                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {2:1}                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : Y = abstractProjectiveSpace(3, B)                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = Y                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {1, 3}                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : i = map(Y,X,OO_X(3)) --includes P^1 into P^3 as the twisted cubic      |
|                                                                             |
|o10 = i                                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : a map to Y from X                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : (Ytilde, PN, PNmap, Ymap) = blowup(i)                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = (Ytilde, PN, PNmap, Ymap)                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : Sequence                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : Ediv = chern(1, exceptionalDivisor Ytilde)                             |
|                                                                             |
|o12 = E                                                                      |
|       0                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|                      QQ[r..t][h, H   ..H   ]                                |
|                                   2,1   2,3                                 |
|      -------------------------------------------------------[E ]            |
|      (- h - H   , - h*H    - H   , - h*H    - H   , -h*H   )  0             |
|              2,1       2,1    2,2       2,2    2,3      2,3                 |
|o12 : -----------------------------------------------------------            |
|                                   2                                         |
|                (H   E , H   E , 3E  - 10H   E  + 9H   )                     |
|                  2,2 0   2,3 0    0      2,1 0     2,2                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : hyperplane = chern(1,OO_Y(1))                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o13 = H                                                                      |
|       2,1                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|                      QQ[r..t][h, H   ..H   ]                                |
|                                   2,1   2,3                                 |
|o13 : -------------------------------------------------------                |
|      (- h - H   , - h*H    - H   , - h*H    - H   , -h*H   )                |
|              2,1       2,1    2,2       2,2    2,3      2,3                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i14 : (rsurf, ssurf, tsurf) = (x -> hyperplane * x) \ (r,s,t) --classes of   |
|                                                                             |
|o14 = (r*H   , s*H   , t*H   )                                               |
|          2,1     2,1     2,1                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o14 : Sequence                                                               |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|surfaces of degrees r,s,t                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i15 : (ptr, pts, ptt) = (x -> (Ymap^* x) - Ediv) \ oo --proper transforms of |
|                                                                             |
|o15 = (- E  + r*H   , - E  + s*H   , - E  + t*H   )                          |
|          0      2,1     0      2,1     0      2,1                           |
|                                                                             |
|o15 : Sequence                                                               |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|each surface                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i16 : integral(ptr * pts * ptt)                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o16 = r*s*t - 3r - 3s - 3t + 10                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o16 : QQ[r..t]                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

The file Schubert2/blowup-test.m2 has several more examples.

