ChernClassVariable -- the class of all Chern class variables
************************************************************

Description
===========

This class supports the creation of variables, analogous to *note indexed
variables: (Macaulay2Doc)IndexedVariable,, that can be used as generators of
intersection rings of abstract varieties that are displayed in the form c_iE,
where i is a natural number and E is the name of an abstract sheaf.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : F = flagBundle({3,2},VariableNames => {{chern_1 S .. chern_3 S},{chern_1|
|                                                                             |
|o1 = F                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {3, 2}                             |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Q,chern_2 Q}})                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = intersectionRing F                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = A                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : (S,Q) = bundles F                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = (S, Q)                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : chern Q                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = 1 + c Q + c Q                                                           |
|          1     2                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : chern S                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|                     2                  3                                    |
|o5 = 1 - c Q + ((c Q)  - c Q) + (- (c Q)  + 2*c Q*c Q)                       |
|          1       1       2          1         1   2                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : A                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

