      * F, an *note abstract sheaf: AbstractSheaf,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, the top Chern class
        of $F$

Description
===========

Here we compute the top Chern class of a vector bundle of rank 6 on the way
toward getting the number of lines on quintic threefold.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G = flagBundle{3,2}                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = G                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {3, 2}                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : B = symmetricPower_5 last bundles G                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = B                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : an abstract sheaf of rank 6 on G                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : ctop B                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|          3                                                                  |
|o3 = 2875H                                                                   |
|          2,2                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|                                            QQ[][H   ..H   , H   ..H   ]     |
|                                                  1,1   1,3   2,1   2,2      |
|o3 : ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     (- H    - H   , - H    - H   H    - H   , - H    - H   H    - H   H   , |
|         1,1    2,1     1,2    1,1 2,1    2,2     1,3    1,2 2,1    1,1 2,2  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|---------------------------------                                            |
|- H   H    - H   H   , -H   H   )                                            |
|   1,3 2,1    1,2 2,2    1,3 2,2                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : degree oo                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {6}                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : integral ooo                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = 2875                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

