determinant(AbstractSheaf) -- determinant of an abstract sheaf
**************************************************************

  * Function: *note determinant: (Macaulay2Doc)determinant,
  * Usage: 
        det F
  * Inputs:
      * F, an *note abstract sheaf: AbstractSheaf,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Strategy: (Macaulay2Doc)determinant_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStrategy=>_pd_
        pd_pd_rp, => ..., default value null,
  * Outputs:
      * an *note abstract sheaf: AbstractSheaf,, the determinant of F

Description
===========

The determinant of F is the $n$-th exterior power of F, where $n$ is the rank
of F.

+-----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : X = abstractProjectiveSpace 1             |
|                                               |
|o1 = X                                         |
|                                               |
|o1 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {2:1}|
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = OO_X(1) ++ OO_X(1) ++ OO_X(3)         |
|                                               |
|o2 = F                                         |
|                                               |
|o2 : an abstract sheaf of rank 3 on X          |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : det F                                     |
|                                               |
|o3 = a sheaf                                   |
|                                               |
|o3 : an abstract sheaf of rank 1 on X          |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i4 : chern oo                                  |
|                                               |
|o4 = 1 + 5H                                    |
|           2,1                                 |
|                                               |
|         QQ[][h, H   ]                         |
|                  2,1                          |
|o4 : ---------------------                     |
|     (- h - H   , -h*H   )                     |
|             2,1      2,1                      |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i5 : rank ooo                                  |
|                                               |
|o5 = 1                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------+

