extensionAlgebra -- extend a graded algebra by a graded module
**************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        extensionAlgebra(f,c)
        extensionAlgebra(f,c,Codimension => r)
        extensionAlgebra(f,c,CoefficientRing => S)
        extensionAlgebra(f,c,Codimension => r, CoefficientRing => S)
  * Inputs:
      * f, from A to B
      * c, a homogeneous element of B
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Codimension => an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, default value null,
        the desired degree of the inclusion map from B to E; only required if c
        = 0, and otherwise must match degree of c
      * CoefficientRing => a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, default value
        null, a coefficient ring of A, which will be used as the coefficient
        ring of the output
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, the algebra obtained by making the
        direct sum of A and B[-r] into an algebra with the multiplication rule
        (a+b)(a'+b') = aa' + ab' + a'b + cbb'.
  * Consequences:
      * An algebra E is created and promotion methods from A and B to E and
        vice-versa are installed.  The natural pullback map from E to B given
        by sending a+b to f(a) + cb is stored in E.PullBack, see *note
        PullBack: PullBack,.

Description
===========

+-------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ[x]                 |
|                               |
|o1 = A                         |
|                               |
|o1 : PolynomialRing            |
+-------------------------------+
|i2 : B = QQ[y]                 |
|                               |
|o2 = B                         |
|                               |
|o2 : PolynomialRing            |
+-------------------------------+
|i3 : c = 2_B                   |
|                               |
|o3 = 2                         |
|                               |
|o3 : B                         |
+-------------------------------+
|i4 : f = map(B,A,gens B)       |
|                               |
|o4 = map (B, A, {y})           |
|                               |
|o4 : RingMap B <-- A           |
+-------------------------------+
|i5 : extensionAlgebra(f,c)     |
|                               |
|     QQ[E , x]                 |
|         0                     |
|o5 = ---------                 |
|       2                       |
|      E  - 2E                  |
|       0     0                 |
|                               |
|o5 : QuotientRing              |
+-------------------------------+
|i6 : oo.PullBack               |
|                               |
|             QQ[E , x]         |
|                 0             |
|o6 = map (B, ---------, {2, y})|
|               2               |
|              E  - 2E          |
|               0     0         |
|                               |
|                   QQ[E , x]   |
|                       0       |
|o6 : RingMap B <-- ---------   |
|                     2         |
|                    E  - 2E    |
|                     0     0   |
+-------------------------------+

