map(FlagBundle,AbstractVariety,AbstractSheaf) -- maps to projective bundles
***************************************************************************

  * Function: *note map: (Macaulay2Doc)map,
  * Usage: 
        map(P,X,L)
  * Inputs:
      * P, an *note abstract flag bundle: FlagBundle,, the projectivization of
        some vector bundle E
      * X, an *note abstract variety: AbstractVariety,, 
      * L, an *note abstract sheaf: AbstractSheaf,, a line bundle on X, the
        desired pullback of $O_P(1)$.
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Degree: (Macaulay2Doc)map_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmDegree=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, =>
        ..., default value null,
      * *note DegreeLift: (Macaulay2Doc)map_lpRing_cmRing_cmMatrix_rp, => ...,
        default value null,
      * *note DegreeMap: (Macaulay2Doc)map_lpRing_cmRing_cmMatrix_rp, => ...,
        default value null,
  * Outputs:
      * an *note abstract variety map: AbstractVarietyMap,, the map from X to P
        such that the pullback of $O_P(1)$ is $L$

Description
===========

Accepts both Grothendieck-style and Fulton-style ${\mathbb P}(E)$, but in the
case a decision cannot be made based on ranks (i.e. when $E$ has rank $2$),
defaults to Fulton-style notation (so ${\mathbb P}(E)$ is the space of
sub-line-bundles of $E$).

Does not check whether $L$ is basepoint-free.  Weird results are probably
possible if $L$ is not.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : X = flagBundle({2,2}) --the Grassmannian GG(1,3)                        |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = X                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {2:2}                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : (S,Q) = bundles X                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = (S, Q)                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : L = exteriorPower(2,dual S)                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = L                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : an abstract sheaf of rank 1 on X                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : P = flagBundle({5,1}) --Grothendieck-style PP^5                         |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = P                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : a flag bundle with subquotient ranks {5, 1}                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : f = map(P,X,L) -- Plücker embedding of GG(1,3) in PP^5                  |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = f                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : a map to P from X                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : H = last bundles P                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = H                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : an abstract sheaf of rank 1 on P                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : f^* (chern(1,H)) -- hyperplane section, should be sigma_1               |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = H                                                                       |
|      2,1                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|                                   QQ[][H   ..H   ]                          |
|                                         1,1   2,2                           |
|o7 : ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     (- H    - H   , - H    - H   H    - H   , - H   H    - H   H   , -H   H |
|         1,1    2,1     1,2    1,1 2,1    2,2     1,2 2,1    1,1 2,2    1,2 2|
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|---                                                                          |
|  )                                                                          |
|,2                                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : f_* chern(0,S) --expect 2 times hyperplane class since GG(1,3) has degre|
|                                                                             |
|o8 = 2H                                                                      |
|       2,1                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|                                             QQ[][H   ..H   , H   ]          |
|                                                   1,1   1,5   2,1           |
|o8 : ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     (- H    - H   , - H    - H   H   , - H    - H   H   , - H    - H   H   ,|
|         1,1    2,1     1,2    1,1 2,1     1,3    1,2 2,1     1,4    1,3 2,1 |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|e 2                                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|------------------------------                                               |
| - H    - H   H   , -H   H   )                                               |
|    1,5    1,4 2,1    1,5 2,1                                                |
