schubertRing -- get the Schubert ring of a Grassmannian
*******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        schubertRing G
  * Inputs:
      * G, an *note abstract flag bundle: FlagBundle,, a Grassmannian, with
        intersection ring $R$, say
  * Outputs:
