|                                                                             |
|               2                                                             |
|o6 = integral(c c  - c c t  - c c  + c t )                                   |
|               1 3    1 3 1    2 3    3 2                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : Expression of class Adjacent                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : chi ((tangentBundle Y)(n))                                              |
|                                                                             |
|               2   2                         1 2     3         7   2   5     |
|o7 = integral(n c h  - 2n*c c h + 2n*c t h + -c c  - -c c t  + -c t  + -c c  |
|                 3         1 3        3 1    3 1 3   2 1 3 1   6 3 1   6 2 3 |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : Expression of class Adjacent                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  5                                                                          |
|- -c t )                                                                     |
|  6 3 2                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

The intersection ring provided for the zero locus contains only those classes
arising by pull-back from the ambient variety: there is no algorithm to compute
the intersection ring.

