|         1   3                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : segre B                                                           |
|                                                                       |
|                2           3                   4     2      2         |
|o3 = 1 + b  + (b  - b ) + (b  - 2b b  + b ) + (b  - 3b b  + b  + 2b b )|
|          1     1    2      1     1 2    3      1     1 2    2     1 3 |
|                                                                       |
|o3 : QQ[b ..b ]                                                        |
|         1   3                                                         |
